      <common:UUID>3cc82472-0a7c-420a-a8df-973be39d550c</common:UUID>
      <name>
        <baseName xml:lang="en">Hard sheep milk cheese, with packaging, 10g dry matter, IT</baseName>
      </name>
      <common:synonyms>Formaggio ovino a pasta dura, incluso imballaggio, 10 g di sostanza secca, IT</common:synonyms>
      <classificationInformation>
        <common:classification name="ILCDCategories" classes="../ILCDClassification.xml">
          <common:class level="0">Materials production</common:class>
          <common:class level="1">Other materials</common:class>
        </common:classification>
      </classificationInformation>
      <common:generalComment>Dataset developed within "LIFE MAGIS - Made Green in Italy Scheme" project. The dataset refers to the production of hard sheep milk cheese in Sardinia (IT) and include the milk production at farm, cheese manufacturing at plant, packaging, distribution, use and end of life stages. It is representative of the majority italian hard sheep milk cheeses production.</common:generalComment>
      <referenceToExternalDocumentation type="source data set" refObjectId="1a4b4a3c-2442-450e-b825-4df5f4ebe954" version="01.00.000" uri="../sources/1a4b4a3c-2442-450e-b825-4df5f4ebe954.xml">
        <common:shortDescription>Information on www.lifemagis.eu.&#13;
Background datasets from Ecoinvent database cut-off v 3.6 were used for the LCA study</common:shortDescription>
      </referenceToExternalDocumentation>
    </dataSetInformation>
    <quantitativeReference type="Reference flow(s)">
      <referenceToReferenceFlow>0</referenceToReferenceFlow>
    </quantitativeReference>
    <time>
      <common:referenceYear>2020</common:referenceYear>
      <common:dataSetValidUntil>2025</common:dataSetValidUntil>
    </time>
    <geography>
      <locationOfOperationSupplyOrProduction location="IT">
        <descriptionOfRestrictions>primary data collected in Sardinia (IT)</descriptionOfRestrictions>
      </locationOfOperationSupplyOrProduction>
    </geography>
    <technology>
      <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>Milk collection for the hard milk cheese production involves all Sardinia territory.  65% of the sheep milk come from high productivity rate farms and the remaining 35% from low productivity rate farms. More information on sheep milk production in Sardinia available on www.Sheeptoship.eu. 4 cheese plants located in Sardinia were selected for the cheese production phase modellation. Cheese manufacturing at plant include products, water and energy  use. Distribution, packaging, use and end of life phases are included. Background data were modelled according to Ecoinvent 3.6.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
    </technology>
  </processInformation>
